{"data": {"event": {"id": "85bd21ab-2ea0-4a7a-b2fc-e7b47b71c1fa", "picture": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/805/video/thumbs/poster.jpg", "sessionType": "S\u00e9ances de cours", "sessionTypeColor": "#6545fa", "voting": null, "title": "Comment d\u00e9buter et developper une activit\u00e9 de thermo-ablation pulmonaire?", "start": "2026-10-09T14:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-09T15:00+02:00", "objectives": ["<ol data-end=\"1263\" data-start=\"337\">", "\t<li data-end=\"502\" data-start=\"337\">", "\t<p data-end=\"502\" data-start=\"340\"><strong data-end=\"399\" data-start=\"340\">Identifier les pr\u00e9requis organisationnels et techniques</strong> <strong>n\u00e9cessaires pour d\u00e9marrer et d\u00e9velopper une activit\u00e9 de thermo-ablation pulmonaire en toute s\u00e9curit\u00e9.</strong></p>", "\t</li>", "\t<li><strong data-end=\"555\" data-start=\"506\">Mettre en place un parcours patient structur\u00e9</strong>, incluant consultation, planification du geste, anticipation des complications et suivi post-proc\u00e9dure.</li>", "\t<li data-end=\"829\" data-start=\"662\">", "\t<p data-end=\"829\" data-start=\"665\"><strong data-end=\"723\" data-start=\"665\">Choisir la technique de thermoablation la plus adapt\u00e9e</strong> (radiofr\u00e9quence ou cryoth\u00e9rapie) en fonction du nombre, de la taille et de la localisation des l\u00e9sions</p>", "\t</li>", "\t<li data-end=\"1002\" data-start=\"830\">", "\t<p data-end=\"1002\" data-start=\"833\"><strong data-end=\"879\" data-start=\"833\">Ma\u00eetriser la r\u00e9alisation pratique du geste</strong>, en int\u00e9grant les sp\u00e9cificit\u00e9s des techniques de RF et de cryoth\u00e9rapie<br>", "\t&nbsp;</p>", "\t</li>", "\t<li data-end=\"1263\" data-start=\"1003\">", "\t<p data-end=\"1263\" data-start=\"1006\"><strong data-end=\"1058\" data-start=\"1006\">Reconna\u00eetre, pr\u00e9venir et g\u00e9rer les complications en insistant sur l'importance&nbsp;d'une&nbsp;gestion rigoureuse du pneumothorax.</strong></p>", "\t</li>", "</ol>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "9fcb28b3-5fb3-4d5d-ac63-87d53367941e", "name": "251", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "73dc0edb-63ed-40a8-9ed7-4a698966bd77", "title": "Organisation et parcours patient en thermo-ablation pulmonaire", "start": "2026-10-09T14:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-09T14:15+02:00", "element": {"abstract": {"id": "73DC0EDB-63ED-40A8-9ED7-4A698966BD77"}}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "7809924e-e14d-4763-bc4f-d2c41ed4fc1f", "lastName": "Piana", "firstName": "Gilles", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": {"url": "https://services.y-congress.com/congress/wspreview/getphoto.aspx?idPhoto=202534&t=1"}, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "Marseille"}}]}, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": {"id": "2be04c4e-8ec4-47f0-becb-3ddde65d5ccb", "type": "VIDEO", "thumbnail": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/805/video/thumbs/poster.jpg", "element": {"sources": [{"uri": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/805/video/y_1080p_4000kb.mp4?verify=1792015822-NFmdMQfsecUDqMiFSoMz2AL7p8XclCmxPEYmA8zxwiE%3D"}, {"uri": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/805/video/y_480p_800kb.mp4?verify=1792015822-WrDQK7VKY5h4tyQ0QsxR%2FEfyBn05BVNoVSKpyCsI8vo%3D"}]}}}}, {"id": "6295799b-04e2-49b5-b52a-4bf773177b48", "title": "Choix des techniques de thermoablation pulmonaire : radiofr\u00e9quence ou cryoth\u00e9rapie?", "start": "2026-10-09T14:15+02:00", "end": "2026-10-09T14:30+02:00", "element": {"abstract": {"id": "6295799B-04E2-49B5-B52A-4BF773177B48"}}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "35f93dea-dcd1-4811-a585-ce3ee20b4016", "lastName": "Daidj", "firstName": "Nassima", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": null, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "Marseille "}}]}, "vod": {"checkPer